<%= render "shared/nav" %>

<section  id="about-main">
   

    <div id= "about-photo-bg" >
        <div class = "about-text-container">

            <div id="about-title-box">
                <h1>Hi! Im Vlad</h1>
                <h2> A front-end web developer from Florida.</h2>
            </div>

            <div id="about-text" >
                <p>I've always enjoyed games, music, drawing, and making things with my hands, 
                so originally I thought game development would be my path. Then I got introduced to web dev and dove right in — that was 7 years ago. 
                I've since spent the last 4 years building professionally on the front end. </p>
                
                <p>I graduated from Broward College with a Bachelors of Applied Science in Information Technology, with a specialization in Web Development (a mouthful, I know), and I've spent those years sharpening my front end skills on real projects. </p>

                <p>Outside of code, I'm usually spending time with family, designing and or printing graphics and printables — business cards, flyers, 
                T-shirts — for small businesses, gaming, or making music.</p>
                
                <p>I'm currently open for work and excited to join a team of like-minded people building great things for the web.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="about-pg-img-contatiner">
            <%= image_tag "computer-with-prints.jpg", alt: "photo of mountain road", id: "about-pg-img" %>
        </div>
    </div>


</section>




